---
description: Rules for LiteLLM chat calls inside LLM chat elements.
globs: "**/llm_chat/**/*.py"
---
- `LLMChatModel.generate_response` converts payloads with `_messages_to_litellm` and calls `litellm.acompletion`. `LLMChatElement.create_model_selector_view` defaults `provider` to OpenAI and can also select Anthropic, Gemini, xAI, Groq, Mistral, and OpenRouter, plus Custom when models are passed.
- `langchain-text-splitters` splits text in the chunker. It does not perform chat completions.
